TI  - MODELING AMMONIA VOLATILIZATION FROM LOAMY SAND SOIL TREATED WITH LIQUID UREA
AU  - Ismail, K. M.
AU  - Wheaton, F. W.
AU  - Douglass, L. W.
AU  - Potts, W.
